        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "There is an aperiodic regular Toeplitz subshift $Y\\subset A^{\\Z}$, which is strictly ergodic, with the following property. For every $\\ell\\geq2$ and every permutative $h:A^\\ell\\to A$, there is a homeomorphism\n\\[\n \\Theta_h:\\eta_h^{-1}(Y)\\longrightarrow Y\\times A^{\\ell-1}\n\\]\nwhose first coordinate is $\\eta_h$ and which conjugates $S$ to $S\\times\\id$. In particular, every such entire lift is nonminimal.",
